{"page":581,"width":1675,"height":2549,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"644","words":[{"text":"644","x":175,"y":152,"width":56,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 14 파일 시스템 구현","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":299,"y":155,"width":115,"height":28},{"text":"14","x":426,"y":156,"width":35,"height":22},{"text":"파일","x":489,"y":156,"width":41,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":539,"y":157,"width":62,"height":25},{"text":"구현","x":610,"y":158,"width":41,"height":25}]},{"text":"이 문제의 해결 방한은 파일 시스템 메타데이터 갱신에 로그 기반 복구 기술을 적용","words":[{"text":"이","x":359,"y":279,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"문제의","x":400,"y":279,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"해결","x":502,"y":279,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"방한은","x":572,"y":280,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":672,"y":280,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"시스템","x":744,"y":280,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"메타데이터","x":844,"y":281,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"갱신에","x":1009,"y":281,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"로그","x":1113,"y":285,"width":63,"height":27},{"text":"기반","x":1190,"y":281,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"복구","x":1266,"y":281,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"기술을","x":1346,"y":279,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"적용","x":1458,"y":279,"width":60,"height":36}]},{"text":"하는 것이다. NTFS와 베리다스(Veritas) 파일 시스템 모두 이 기술을 적용하며, Solar-","words":[{"text":"하는","x":301,"y":338,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":375,"y":337,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"NTFS와","x":482,"y":337,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"베리다스(Veritas)","x":611,"y":338,"width":242,"height":40},{"text":"파일","x":867,"y":339,"width":58,"height":37},{"text":"시스템","x":941,"y":339,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"모두","x":1042,"y":342,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":1119,"y":339,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"기술을","x":1163,"y":339,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"적용하며,","x":1273,"y":338,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"Solar-","x":1425,"y":340,"width":93,"height":29}]},{"text":"is 7 그리고 그 이상 버전에서의 UFS에서는 이 기술을 옵션으로 제공한다. 사실상 이 기","words":[{"text":"is","x":300,"y":400,"width":24,"height":28},{"text":"7","x":336,"y":399,"width":16,"height":28},{"text":"그리고","x":364,"y":396,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":464,"y":401,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"이상","x":506,"y":396,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"버전에서의","x":577,"y":396,"width":143,"height":36},{"text":"UFS에서는","x":733,"y":397,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":899,"y":398,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"기술을","x":941,"y":398,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"옵션으로","x":1042,"y":398,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1181,"y":397,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"사실상","x":1333,"y":396,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1445,"y":395,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"기","x":1489,"y":396,"width":25,"height":36}]},{"text":"술은 ext3, ext4와 z卜를 포함한 많은 파일 시스템에서 보편화되어 가고 있다.","words":[{"text":"술은","x":299,"y":454,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"ext3,","x":370,"y":458,"width":70,"height":32},{"text":"ext4와","x":452,"y":454,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"z卜를","x":555,"y":456,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"포함한","x":654,"y":455,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"많은","x":751,"y":455,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":819,"y":455,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"시스템에서","x":889,"y":456,"width":144,"height":36},{"text":"보편화되어","x":1048,"y":456,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"가고","x":1214,"y":456,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1291,"y":455,"width":69,"height":36}]},{"text":"기본적으로 모든 메타데이터 변경은 로그에 순차적으로 기록된다. 특정 태스크를 수","words":[{"text":"기본적으로","x":358,"y":512,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"모든","x":516,"y":515,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"메타데이터","x":587,"y":512,"width":143,"height":37},{"text":"변경은","x":746,"y":512,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"로그에","x":846,"y":515,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"순차적으로","x":947,"y":514,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"기록된다.","x":1116,"y":514,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"특정","x":1265,"y":514,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"태스크를","x":1345,"y":514,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1486,"y":514,"width":31,"height":36}]},{"text":"행하는 연산의 집합 각각을 하나의 트랜책션이라고 한다. 일단 변경이 이 로그에 기록되","words":[{"text":"행하는","x":300,"y":571,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"연산의","x":403,"y":570,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"집합","x":503,"y":571,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"각각을","x":572,"y":571,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"하나의","x":672,"y":571,"width":85,"height":37},{"text":"트랜책션이라고","x":771,"y":572,"width":211,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":994,"y":572,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"일단","x":1080,"y":573,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"변경이","x":1155,"y":573,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1266,"y":574,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"로그에","x":1309,"y":573,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"기록되","x":1423,"y":573,"width":90,"height":35}]},{"text":"면 그들은 확약(commit)된 것으로 간주하고 시스템 콜은 유저 프로세스로 복귀하여 실","words":[{"text":"면","x":300,"y":630,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"그들은","x":340,"y":630,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"확약(commit)된","x":441,"y":629,"width":225,"height":38},{"text":"것으로","x":681,"y":630,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"간주하고","x":779,"y":630,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"시스템","x":912,"y":630,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"콜은","x":1014,"y":632,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"유저","x":1088,"y":632,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"프로세스로","x":1165,"y":633,"width":164,"height":34},{"text":"복귀하여","x":1342,"y":632,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"실","x":1486,"y":633,"width":28,"height":34}]},{"text":"행을 계속하도록 허용한다. 그동안 이 로그 엔트리는 실제 파일 시스템 구조에 대해 재","words":[{"text":"행을","x":299,"y":689,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"계속하도록","x":373,"y":688,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"허용한다.","x":534,"y":688,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"그동안","x":672,"y":688,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":774,"y":689,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"로그","x":816,"y":693,"width":60,"height":26},{"text":"엔트리는","x":890,"y":689,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"실제","x":1025,"y":690,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":1101,"y":691,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"시스템","x":1180,"y":691,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"구조에","x":1292,"y":692,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"대해","x":1408,"y":691,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"재","x":1485,"y":692,"width":27,"height":35}]},{"text":"실행된다. 변경이 반영되는 동안, 어느 동작이 끝났는지 그리고 어느 것이 아직 덜 끝났","words":[{"text":"실행된다.","x":299,"y":747,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"변경이","x":440,"y":746,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"반영되는","x":540,"y":747,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"동안,","x":668,"y":747,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"어느","x":749,"y":747,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"동작이","x":820,"y":748,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"끝났는지","x":922,"y":748,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"그리고","x":1059,"y":749,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"어느","x":1170,"y":750,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"것이","x":1249,"y":751,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"아직","x":1328,"y":751,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"덜","x":1408,"y":750,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"끝났","x":1453,"y":751,"width":62,"height":34}]},{"text":"는지를 나타내기 위해 포인터가 갱신된다. 전체 트랜책션이 완료되","words":[{"text":"는지를","x":296,"y":807,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"나타내기","x":398,"y":806,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"위해","x":528,"y":806,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"포인터가","x":597,"y":805,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"갱신된다.","x":728,"y":806,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"전체","x":1166,"y":809,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"트랜책션이","x":1242,"y":810,"width":162,"height":35},{"text":"완료되","x":1420,"y":809,"width":91,"height":35}]},{"text":"그 사실을 나타내는 항목이 로그에 만들어진다. 이 로그 파일은 실제로는 원형 버퍼","words":[{"text":"그","x":348,"y":870,"width":29,"height":24},{"text":"사실을","x":390,"y":865,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"나타내는","x":492,"y":864,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"항목이","x":620,"y":864,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"로그에","x":720,"y":865,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"만들어진다.","x":822,"y":865,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":997,"y":865,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"로그","x":1040,"y":870,"width":63,"height":25},{"text":"파일은","x":1116,"y":867,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"실제로는","x":1228,"y":868,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"원형","x":1376,"y":868,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"버퍼","x":1454,"y":867,"width":57,"height":36}]},{"text":"이다. 원형 버퍼(circular buffer)는 버퍼 공간의 맨 뒤에 기록하고, 맨 앞에서 시작하는","words":[{"text":"이다.","x":297,"y":925,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"원형","x":377,"y":925,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"버퍼(circular","x":448,"y":924,"width":182,"height":38},{"text":"buffer)는","x":640,"y":926,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"버퍼","x":788,"y":923,"width":54,"height":37},{"text":"공간의","x":857,"y":925,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"맨","x":961,"y":925,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"뒤에","x":1004,"y":925,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"기록하고,","x":1079,"y":925,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"맨","x":1230,"y":927,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"앞에서","x":1276,"y":928,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"시작하는","x":1388,"y":927,"width":127,"height":34}]},{"text":"연속적인 공간으로 구성된다. 이러한 원형 버퍼는 연속적으로 기록되므로, 이전의 데이","words":[{"text":"연속적인","x":297,"y":983,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"공간으로","x":428,"y":983,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"구성된다.","x":558,"y":982,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"이러한","x":700,"y":983,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"원형","x":801,"y":984,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"버퍼는","x":875,"y":984,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"연속적으로","x":981,"y":984,"width":155,"height":35},{"text":"기록되므로,","x":1152,"y":985,"width":172,"height":36},{"text":"이전의","x":1341,"y":985,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"데이","x":1454,"y":985,"width":57,"height":36}]},{"text":"터 위에 겹쳐서 기록될 것이다. 따라서 원형 버퍼를 시용할 경우에는, 아직 저장되지 않","words":[{"text":"터","x":296,"y":1042,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"위에","x":338,"y":1042,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"겹쳐서","x":412,"y":1042,"width":83,"height":35},{"text":"기록될","x":512,"y":1042,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":613,"y":1042,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":721,"y":1043,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"원형",